==English==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|en|leary}}

===Etymology===
1718, “untrustful, suspicious”, either from {{suf|en|leer|t1=sideward look|y|id2=adjectival}}, {{suf|en|lear|t1=learning, knowledge|y|id2=adjectival}}. More at {{m|en|leer}}, {{m|en|lear}}.

